id: pm-rl-history-status-roles
title: Use configured terminal status roles when projecting improver history
description: "The existing projectImproverHistory implementation recognizes terminal events using literal closed, canceled and cancelled strings. Histories from trackers with custom terminal status registries can be omitted from the public improver dataset. The new proposer consumes sealed datasets and its public validation uses SDK roles; change the existing history builder separately with persisted-format compatibility coverage."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
